# Bot2 each discard one card together and take 2 damage.
[Bot1 Deck]
Mind Bomb
Mox Sapphire
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20
[Bot3 Deck]
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
